#: ../../chapter3.rst:7
msgid "Transferring Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:9
msgid "Now you can use the Cloud Storage as if it were a Virtual Drive or Folder. Simply drag and drop to copy local documents to the Cloud Storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:11
msgid "You can access your cloud drive directly with a drive letter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:17
msgid "THE CLOUD DRIVE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:19
msgid "|prodname| Windows Desktop Agent makes it very easy to move data into cloud storage or extract data from cloud storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:22
msgid "Attaching Local Folders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:24
msgid "The virtual drive provides on-demand access to files and folders from the |prodname| Cloud storage account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:26
msgid "Sometimes it is also desirable to work inside a local folder, and have the local folder synchronize with the |prodname| Cloud storage account. You can right click on a local folder (1) and select \"Attach this Folder to |prodname|\" (2). The pop-up (3) shows you where this folder is located on your system and allows you to change the name of the folder if you don't want to use the default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:31
msgid "ATTACH A FOLDER TO |prodname|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:35
msgid "Benefits of Attached folders:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:37
msgid "They will be synchronized with the cloud."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:39
msgid "Their contents immediately become accessible even before the sync is completed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:41
msgid "They can maintain a versioned backup of their contents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:43
msgid "Their content is available locally when offline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter3.rst:45
msgid "They can be used in the same ways as any local folder."
msgstr ""
